    "detailed_description": "In Kazu Aether Origins, the player follows the journey of Kazu, the Finnish Spitz, in a hack/slash adventure on the Isles of Isvenness.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic, Fast-paced Hack/Slash Combat</strong></h2>The journey begins with Kazu, the Finnish Spitz, as he navigates through the Isles of Isvenness unraveling the mysteries of the world.  While traversing the region, you will encounter many combat challenges and satirical elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/ec642363b664fdffbca958505e1756d5.poster.avif?t=1736218286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/ec642363b664fdffbca958505e1756d5.webm?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/ec642363b664fdffbca958505e1756d5.mp4?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a World of Handcrafted Parallax Art</strong></h2>The biomes of Isvenness are intricately drawn based on the over-arching themes of the respective regions.  While traversing the regions, you will encounter uniquely designed environmental and building art.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/e6ad2f6b68b590e60da195f15a5cd37f.poster.avif?t=1736218286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/e6ad2f6b68b590e60da195f15a5cd37f.webm?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/e6ad2f6b68b590e60da195f15a5cd37f.mp4?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Aetheric Boons to Overcome Enemy Groups</strong></h2>An Aetheric Cataclysm has thrown the inhabitants into disarray.  The world is now brimming with unstable Aether which has enhanced creatures with uncontrollable powers and a loss of self control.  Kazu has an innate ability to absorb expelled Aether which enables him to utilize the powers for short periods of time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/f3bbb724c1a510b4d56debcedae0ea1f.poster.avif?t=1736218286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/f3bbb724c1a510b4d56debcedae0ea1f.webm?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/f3bbb724c1a510b4d56debcedae0ea1f.mp4?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vanquish Aether Bosses and the Sources of Corruption</strong></h2>You will be challenged in varying degrees of boss designs employing reactionary timing and mastery of combat mechanics.  On the Isles of Isvenness, the Aethers correspond to sins of corruption.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/9c243985e8ad997c17b7b1061a79d771.poster.avif?t=1736218286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/9c243985e8ad997c17b7b1061a79d771.webm?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/9c243985e8ad997c17b7b1061a79d771.mp4?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive, Dynamic Transitions and Open World World Design</strong></h2>The world is designed with open-exploration providing a non-linear gameplay experience.  Progress through the region at your own pace as you search for the sources of corruption.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/1e076e1c2251d715da82e23ab86ffee9.poster.avif?t=1736218286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/1e076e1c2251d715da82e23ab86ffee9.webm?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/1e076e1c2251d715da82e23ab86ffee9.mp4?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
