ned with open-exploration providing a non-linear gameplay experience.  Progress through the region at your own pace as you search for the sources of corruption.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/1e076e1c2251d715da82e23ab86ffee9.poster.avif?t=1736218286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/1e076e1c2251d715da82e23ab86ffee9.webm?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503640/extras/1e076e1c2251d715da82e23ab86ffee9.mp4?t=1736218286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
